@startuml
title T12-WF14 — AI Customer Feedback Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
actor "Customer Feedback Form/API" as FORM
participant "NestJS Feedback Ingestion API" as API
participant "n8n WF14\nCustomer Feedback" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Gemini API" as AI
participant "NestJS CustomerTask API" as CTASK
participant "NestJS Communication API" as COMM

FORM -> API: POST feedback submission
API -> API: Validate/rate-limit source, authorize customer association, normalize and redact sensitive text
API -> DB: Create WorkflowRun/request record; preserve restricted source reference
DB --> API: workflowRunId
API --> FORM: 202 Accepted + workflowRunId
API -> N8N: POST protected internal webhook with scoped redacted feedback request
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate customer reference, channel and content
N8N -> N8N: Validate redaction metadata and normalize safe feedback text
N8N -> API: GET customer and recent interactions
API -> DB: Read Customer and Interaction records
DB --> API: Customer context
API --> N8N: Context
N8N -> AI: Classify sentiment/category/urgency from redacted content
AI --> N8N: Structured classification + rationale
N8N -> N8N: Validate schema/confidence and derive proposed priority
N8N -> API: POST CustomerFeedback
API -> API: Revalidate fields, permissions and priority policy
API -> DB: Insert CustomerFeedback and audit history
DB --> API: feedbackId + canonical status/priority
API --> N8N: Saved feedback
alt Escalation required by backend policy
  N8N -> CTASK: POST /api/v1/customer-tasks with customerId + feedbackId (canonical)
  CTASK -> DB: Insert/reuse customer_tasks linked to feedbackId idempotently
  DB --> CTASK: taskId/status
  CTASK --> N8N: Task created/already exists
else No escalation required
  N8N -> N8N: Continue with ordinary feedback flow
end
N8N -> COMM: Request backend acknowledgment/owner notification
COMM -> DB: Record communication request/status
DB --> COMM: Communication status
COMM --> N8N: Acknowledgment/notification result
N8N -> API: Record final workflow/callback status
API -> DB: Update WorkflowRun/audit result
DB --> API: Saved status
API --> N8N: Accepted
deactivate N8N
FORM -> API: GET feedback processing result by workflowRunId
API -> DB: Read CustomerFeedback/workflow result
DB --> API: Result/status
API --> FORM: Feedback status/reference
note over API,N8N
The public form calls NestJS, not n8n directly. NestJS protects the internal webhook,
with sensitive feedback fields redacted by NestJS before any AI call. Communication and operational task creation remain backend-owned. `CustomerTask` is the operational task for feedback escalation, distinct from approval-only `ReviewTask`.
end note
@enduml
